<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <meta name="description" content="SNOW workspace for document-based question generation.">
  <title>SNOW Workspace</title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="./src/styles/main.css">
</head>
<body>
  <a class="top-link" href="./login.html">Login</a>

  <div class="screen-layout">
    <aside class="screen-side screen-side-left">
      <div class="left-layout">
        <div class="left-spacer" aria-hidden="true"></div>
        <div class="left-history-slot">
          <aside class="panel history-panel">
            <div class="panel-heading">
              <p class="panel-kicker">History</p>
              <h2>요청 기록</h2>
            </div>
            <p class="history-caption">이전에 실행했던 요청을 빠르게 다시 확인할 수 있습니다.</p>
            <div id="history-list" class="history-list">
              <p class="history-empty">아직 저장된 요청 기록이 없습니다.</p>
            </div>
          </aside>

          <section class="panel document-upload-panel">
            <div class="panel-heading">
              <p class="panel-kicker">Document</p>
              <h2>문서 업로드</h2>
            </div>
            <div class="upload-status-group">
              <label class="upload-dropzone compact-upload inline-uploader" for="document-upload">
                <input id="document-upload" type="file" accept=".pdf,.ppt,.pptx" multiple>
                <strong>문서 업로드</strong>
                <span id="selected-file-name">PDF, PPT, PPTX 여러 개 업로드</span>
              </label>
              <div id="upload-status" class="upload-status idle" aria-live="polite">
                <span class="upload-status-icon"></span>
                <span id="upload-status-text">대기 중</span>
              </div>
              <label class="add-document-button" for="document-upload">문서 업로드</label>
            </div>
          </section>

          <section class="panel uploaded-files-panel">
            <div class="uploaded-files-header">
              <p class="panel-kicker">Uploaded Files</p>
              <h3>업로드된 문서</h3>
            </div>
            <div id="uploaded-files-list" class="uploaded-files-list">
              <p class="uploaded-file-empty">아직 업로드된 문서가 없습니다.</p>
            </div>
          </section>
        </div>
        <div class="left-spacer" aria-hidden="true"></div>
      </div>
    </aside>

    <div class="page-shell">
      <header class="hero">
        <div class="hero-copy">
          <p class="eyebrow">
            <span class="brand-accent brand-s">S</span>mart
            <span class="brand-accent brand-n">N</span>ote
            <span class="brand-accent brand-o">O</span>rganizer for
            <span class="brand-accent brand-w">W</span>eb
          </p>
          <h1>SNOW</h1>
        </div>
        <div class="hero-subtitle-row">
          <p id="hero-status-text" class="hero-subtitle hero-title" contenteditable="true" spellcheck="false" dir="ltr" aria-label="프로젝트 제목"></p>
          <button type="button" id="hero-edit-title" class="hero-edit-button" aria-label="프로젝트 제목 수정">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
              <path d="M4 20h4l10-10a2.5 2.5 0 0 0-4-4L4 16v4z"></path>
              <path d="M13.5 6.5l4 4"></path>
            </svg>
          </button>
        </div>
      </header>

      <main class="dashboard">
        <div id="job-status-message" hidden></div>
        <div class="hidden-controls" hidden>
          <select id="question-type">
            <option value="객관식" selected>객관식</option>
            <option value="단답형">단답형</option>
            <option value="서술형">서술형</option>
          </select>
          <select id="difficulty">
            <option value="easy">쉬움</option>
            <option value="medium" selected>보통</option>
            <option value="hard">어려움</option>
          </select>
          <select id="question-count">
            <option value="3">3문항</option>
            <option value="5" selected>5문항</option>
            <option value="10">10문항</option>
          </select>
        </div>

        <section class="panel output-panel">
          <div class="panel-heading panel-row">
            <div>
              <p class="panel-kicker">Output</p>
              <h2>텍스트 출력</h2>
            </div>
            <button type="button" id="copy-button" class="ghost-button">출력 복사</button>
          </div>
          <div id="output-window" class="output-window" aria-live="polite">
            아직 생성된 결과가 없습니다. 아래 입력창에서 요청을 작성한 뒤 실행해보세요.
          </div>
          <div id="result-cards" class="result-cards">
            <article class="result-card">
              <p class="result-label">미리보기</p>
              <h3>생성된 문제와 요약 결과가 이 영역에 표시됩니다.</h3>
              <p>실제 연결 전에는 더미 결과가 나타나고, 이후 정답과 해설 패널을 붙일 수 있습니다.</p>
            </article>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section class="panel input-panel">
          <div class="panel-heading panel-row">
            <div>
              <p class="panel-kicker">Prompt</p>
              <h2>텍스트 입력</h2>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="field-grid">
            <label class="textarea-wrap field-span-2">
              <span>출제 범위 또는 요청</span>
              <textarea id="prompt-input" placeholder="예: 운영체제 핵심 개념 위주로 객관식 5문항과 서술형 2문항을 생성해줘."></textarea>
            </label>

          </div>

          <div class="controls">
            <button type="button" id="sample-button" class="ghost-button">샘플 요청 넣기</button>
            <button type="button" id="generate-button" class="primary-button">실행하기</button>
            <button type="button" id="reset-button" class="ghost-button">초기화</button>
          </div>

        </section>
      </main>
    </div>

    <aside class="screen-side screen-side-right">
      <div class="right-layout">
        <div class="right-spacer" aria-hidden="true"></div>
        <div class="right-settings-slot">
          <button type="button" id="quiz-settings-toggle" class="quiz-toggle" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-controls="quiz-settings-panel">
            퀴즈
          </button>
          <a class="explanation-link" href="./explanation.html">해설</a>
        </div>
        <section class="panel notebook-panel">
          <div class="panel-heading">
            <p class="panel-kicker">Notebook</p>
          </div>
          <div class="notebook-actions">
            <button type="button" id="notebook-new" class="ghost-button">새 Notebook</button>
            <button type="button" id="notebook-save" class="primary-button">저장</button>
          </div>
          <label class="select-wrap notebook-select-wrap">
            <span>저장된 Notebook</span>
            <select id="notebook-select"></select>
          </label>
          <button type="button" id="notebook-load" class="ghost-button notebook-load">불러오기</button>
          <button type="button" id="notebook-delete" class="ghost-button notebook-delete">삭제</button>
          <p id="notebook-status" class="notebook-status" aria-live="polite">현재 작업공간을 저장하거나 불러올 수 있습니다.</p>
        </section>
        <div class="right-spacer" aria-hidden="true"></div>
      </div>
    </aside>
  </div>

  <div id="quiz-settings-modal" class="settings-modal" hidden>
    <div class="settings-backdrop" data-close-settings></div>
    <section id="quiz-settings-panel" class="panel settings-panel settings-dialog" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="quiz-settings-title">
      <div class="panel-heading panel-row">
        <div>
          <p class="panel-kicker">Settings</p>
          <h2 id="quiz-settings-title">생성 설정</h2>
        </div>
        <button type="button" class="settings-close" data-close-settings aria-label="닫기">×</button>
      </div>

      <div class="setting-group">
        <p>문제 유형</p>
        <div class="setting-options" role="group" aria-label="문제 유형">
          <button type="button" class="setting-button is-active" data-setting-target="question-type" data-setting-value="객관식">객관식</button>
          <button type="button" class="setting-button" data-setting-target="question-type" data-setting-value="단답형">단답형</button>
          <button type="button" class="setting-button" data-setting-target="question-type" data-setting-value="서술형">서술형</button>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="setting-group">
        <p>난이도</p>
        <div class="setting-options" role="group" aria-label="난이도">
          <button type="button" class="setting-button" data-setting-target="difficulty" data-setting-value="easy">쉬움</button>
          <button type="button" class="setting-button is-active" data-setting-target="difficulty" data-setting-value="medium">보통</button>
          <button type="button" class="setting-button" data-setting-target="difficulty" data-setting-value="hard">어려움</button>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="setting-group">
        <p>문제 수</p>
        <div class="setting-options" role="group" aria-label="문제 수">
          <button type="button" class="setting-button" data-setting-target="question-count" data-setting-value="3">3문항</button>
          <button type="button" class="setting-button is-active" data-setting-target="question-count" data-setting-value="5">5문항</button>
          <button type="button" class="setting-button" data-setting-target="question-count" data-setting-value="10">10문항</button>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="settings-actions">
        <button type="button" id="quiz-settings-confirm" class="primary-button settings-confirm">확인</button>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>

  <script src="./src/main.js" defer></script>
</body>
</html>
